sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Customer as 顾客
  participant Web as Web 商城
  participant API as 订单 API
  participant Inv as 库存
  participant Bank as 支付网关
  Customer->>Web: 提交结账
  Web->>API: POST /orders
  activate API
  API->>Inv: reserve(lines)
  alt 库存不足
    Inv-->>API: Reject
    API-->>Web: 409 OutOfStock
  else 库存 OK
    Inv-->>API: Reserved
    API->>Bank: capture(total)
    Bank-->>API: Approved
    API-->>Web: 201 Created
  end
  deactivate API
  Web-->>Customer: 下单结果
  Note over Customer,Bank: 一笔订单，一次扣款
